      "body": "<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">Liability Waiver & Release</h4>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>THIS LIABILITY WAIVER & RELEASE</strong> (this \"Agreement\") made this <b><u>{{Agreement_Day}}</u></b> day of <b><u>{{Agreement_Month}}</u></b>, <b><u>{{Agreement_Year}}</u></b><br/><br/><strong>BETWEEN</strong><br/> <div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Collabüro</strong>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">at</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">499 Preston St. Ottawa, ON K1S 4N7</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">(the \"Organisation\", \"Event Space Provider\", \"our\" or \"we\")</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">and</div> <div style=\"text-align:center\"><b><u>{{Client_Display_Name}}</u></b></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">(the \"Client\", \"you\" or \"your\")</div><br/> IN CONSIDERATION OF the covenants and agreements contained in this agreement and other good and valuable consideration, the receipt of which is hereby acknowledged, the parties to this Agreement agree as follows:<br/> <br/> <strong>Consideration</strong><br/> <ol type=\"1\"> <li> The Client releases and forever discharges the Organization / Event Space Provider, its owners, directors, officers, employees, agents, assigns, legal representatives and successors from all manner of actions, causes of action, debts, contracts, claims and demands for or by reason of any legal, financial or health-related damage including any loss caused by violation of the Government of Ontario health mandates applicable at the time of the event.<br/> </li> <li> The Client understands that the Client would not be permitted to use the facility for the described event below unless the Client is in agreement with this Agreement. The act of making your deposit payment for the space rented, constitutes your agreement to the Terms and Conditions and the Liability Waiver & Release in lieu of your signature. The assumption is that by proceeding you have read and agreed to abide by the details in the attached addendum. You are welcome or maybe requested to sign and return these agreements to the Organisation.<br/> </li> </ol> <br/><strong >Details of Event</strong><br/> <ol start=\"3\"> <li> The Client will be renting the facility from the Event Space Provider for the following event: <u>{{Event_Description}}</u><br/><br/>Expected number of people attending the event: <u>{{Expected_Number_of_Attendees}}</u>.<br/> </ol> Space Rented: <table> <tr> <td> <div style=\"margin-left:50px\">☐ Main Hall</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div style=\"margin-left:50px\">☐ Large Room</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div style=\"margin-left:50px\">☐ Elevated Area</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div style=\"margin-left:50px\">☐ Lounge</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div style=\"margin-left:50px\">☐ Small Meeting Room</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div style=\"margin-left:50px\">☐ Back Patio</div> </td> </tr> </table><br/> <strong><u>Concurrent Release</u></strong><br/> 4. The Client acknowledges that this Agreement is given with the express intention of effecting the extinguishment of certain obligations owed to the Client and with the intention of binding the Client's spouse, heirs, executors, administrators, legal representatives and assigns.\n<br/><br/>\n<strong><u>Following Mandate</u></strong><br/>\n5. The Client acknowledges that the Client is aware that the Client is fully responsible to enforce any current health mandates by the Government for their scheduled event in accordance with the rules set-out on the date of the event. <br/><br/>\n6. The Client will only allow people from their attendee list into the building and will not allow any outsiders into the building or leave any guests on the premises when they leave. Approval must be given for decorators, caterers, etc to be on site when the client is not.\n<br/><br/>\n7. The Client understands that an Organisation representative may or may not be in the building at the time of the event and that the Client is solely responsible for ensuring that mandate rules are followed and applied during the event and the building is secure upon departure.\n<br/><br/>\n<strong><u>Full and Final Settlement</u></strong><br/>\n8. The Client hereby acknowledges and agrees that they have carefully read this Agreement, and is freely and voluntarily executing the contents.\n<br/><br/>\n9. The Client understands that by signing this Agreement, the Client agrees to be forever prevented from suing or otherwise claiming against the Organization / Event Space Provider for any legal, financial or health-related damage or loss that the Client may sustain while using the facility and also due to any activity or participation in violation of the current health mandates set out by the Government of Ontario including any restrictions or curfews in place. This also includes any fines imposed including as a result of:- failing to have required licenses; intoxication; underage drinking; noise complaints; criminal or anti-social behaviour; or parking violations.\n<br/><br/>\n10. The Client has been given the opportunity and has been encouraged to seek independent legal advice prior to signing this Agreement.\n<br/><br/>\n11. This Agreement contains the entire agreement between the parties to this Agreement and the terms of this Agreement are contractual and not a mere recital.\n<br/><br/>\n<strong><u>Governing Law</u></strong><br/> 12. This Agreement will be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Province of Ontario.<br/>\n<br/><br/>\n<strong>IN WITNESS WHEREOF the Client and Event Space Provider have duly affixed their signatures on this <b><u>{{Agreement_Day}}</u></b> day of <b><u>{{Agreement_Month}}</u></b>, <b><u>{{Agreement_Year}}</u></b><br/><br/><u>{{Client_Display_Name}}</u><br/>Client Name and Signature </div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><h4",
